</style>
<h2>Asobi Review 0.2 (build 565)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Drag to reorder the playlist.</b> Grab a clip's thumbnail in the Playlist panel and drop it where it goes — a line shows where it will land, and a version stack moves as one. The room follows, and when the host or another seat reorders, your playlist follows too.</li>
<li><b>The web review's playlist has thumbnails now, and they're the handles.</b> Drag clips into a new order there as well.</li>
<li><b>Fixed on the web: marks, stills and the gamma menu while a grade is applied live.</b> The picture that carried the host's live grade sat on top of everything in the browser — marks and the full-resolution still were hidden, and the gamma menu appeared to do nothing. All three show now, and the picture keeps its shape in any window.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
